    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) The perimeter is the distance around a shape.\nAdd the lengths of all sides to get the perimeter.\nA rectangle with sides 5 cm and 3 cm has perimeter 5 + 3 + 5 + 3 = 16 cm.\nA string can be used to measure around a curved shape."
